  <!-- EN: Trade Festival -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>貿易節日</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The annual Trade Festival has begun! During the festival, Kiiro shops in the colony will sell goods at discounted prices and purchase items at favorable rates. Friendly faction caravans will also visit more frequently.\n\nThe festival will last for [durationDays] days. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>一年一度的貿易節日開始了！節日期間，殖民地的綺羅商舖會以折扣的價格售賣商品，並且以優惠的價格收購貨物；友好派系的商隊訪問也會變得頻繁。\n\n節日將持續[durationDays]日。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival: {0} -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.label.slateRef>貿易節日：{0}</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro merchants in the colony are hosting a Trade Festival. During the festival, trade prices with the shops will be adjusted by {0}, and caravans will visit more frequently.\n\nRemaining time of the festival: {{0}}. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.explanation.slateRef>殖民地的綺羅商戶們正在舉辦貿易節日。節日期間與商舖的交易價格偏移{0}，商隊會更頻繁地來訪。\n\n節日剩餘時間：{{0}}</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.TradeFestivalAlert.explanation.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival end -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>貿易節日結束</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: This year's Trade Festival has ended. Trade with the merchants will return to normal prices. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>今年的貿易節日結束了。在商舖的交易將恢復正常價格。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Trade Festival end -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>貿易節日結束</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Trade Festival has ended due to the relationship with the Kiiro became hostile. -->
  <Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>因為與綺羅關係變為敵對，貿易節日結束了。</Kiiro_TradeFestival.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
